00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.980
Royalty acquisitions let investors capture cash flow exposure

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.820
to operating mines without funding exploration

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.040
or development risk.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.600
Summit royalties just closed a 1% net smelter return

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.880
on Newmont's saddle north deposit

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.320
for $5 million Canadian shares,

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.420
giving direct participation in future production

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.500
at a fixed cost.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.740
This structure works best when the underlying asset

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:33.120
has proven reserves and the royalty holder

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.500
maintains low overhead.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:38.520
Investors can screen TSX venture royalty companies

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:41.960
for similar deals that deliver production linked returns

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.320
with caped downside.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.060
Custom indexing lets investors build

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.280
a fully personalized index portfolio

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:50.300
without paying management fees,

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:53.640
a structure quest rate just launched for Canadian accounts.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.320
The approach combines a low cost rules-based nature

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.960
of indexing with the ability to exclude

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:04.580
or overweight specific sectors inside a TFSA or RRSP.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:09.140
Geopolitical premium investing involves overweighting assets

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.020
that benefit from policy shifts,

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.660
such as tariffs or critical mineral demand

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.660
rather than broad market beta.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:20.740
Today's proposed 10 to 12.5% duties on 60 trading partners

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:23.640
and the Canadian antimony discovery highlight

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.380
how quickly supply chain security can reprise

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.620
entire sectors.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.600
Share repurchase expansions create a direct capital return

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.060
mechanism that can support share prices

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.000
even when broader markets stall.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.360
Shopify's $3 billion US dollar increase

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.400
to its existing buyback program illustrates this approach

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.920
in a high growth software name trading at elevated multiples.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.880
Investors can screen for companies announcing

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:54.060
or accelerating repurchases by monitoring TSX and SEC filings

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.880
through platforms like TMX Money or Edgar.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.860
Fed speakers emphasizing the duration

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.960
of the balance sheet over its size

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:05.080
point to a refined approach for fixed income allocation.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:08.260
Duration mismatch between the Fed's holdings

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.940
and outstanding treasuries directly influences term premia.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.320
So investors can adjust by extending

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.680
latter maturities when real rates compress.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.140
Non-farm payrolls act as a high frequency gauge

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:22.580
of economic momentum that directly shapes

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:24.160
sector rotation decisions.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:28.000
When actual hiring exceeds consensus by a wide margin

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.320
as it did with 172,000 jobs versus 85,000 expected.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:37.140
Markets typically reprice the path of interest rates higher

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:39.360
boosting financials and value stocks

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.960
while pressuring growth names.

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:45.460
Index reconstitution creates measurable short term price pressure

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:47.460
on both additions and deletions

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:50.640
because passive funds must rebalance holdings on

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.260
or before the effective date.

